      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Took the camera and went into the forest - just to look around. Stood
    behind one bush for about forty minutes, waiting for a tit. It came. The shot
    came out blurry, but that doesn\u2019t matter - I saw it, that\u2019s what matters.
    Don\u2019t know when I started loving birds, but I do now"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
