      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Built the house. Not entirely by myself, of course, I had help - but I
    was there every day, and it''s mine. While we were hammering the last nails,
    I thought: Now there is a place. It used to seem like having a place didn''t
    matter. Now I think it matters.'
