      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'I remember Grandpa used to say: working with your hands is good, your
    head gets to rest afterwards. He was right - while I was chopping, I didn''t
    think about work or any other nonsense at all. I guess that''s why I come here
    - just to breathe.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
